title: Handokdang Conference
subtitle: The Handokdang chooses their new leader...
view-if: year = 1945 and month = 7 and handokdang_party_leader = "Cho So-Ang"
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true

= Handokdang Conference

# reference: Evans, Ellen L. “Adam Stegerwald and the Role of the Christian Trade Unions in the Weimar Republic.” The Catholic Historical Review 59, no. 4 (1974): 602–26.

4th Handokdang party conference will be held in this year, and it's time to re-elect party leader. 

The consensus candidate on the right is Kim Koo, a Catholic priest who represents the party's traditionalists. On the other hand, there is Cho So-Ang, former leader of Handokdang, who has been more supportive of cooperation with the left parties in the Provisional Assembly. He may be more friendly toward our party. 

- @kaas: The Handokdang elects Ludwig Kaas as the party chair.
- @joos: Influence the Handokdang to select Joseph Joos as the party chair.
- @joos_campaign: We must hold a campaign in support of Joseph Joos as party chair.

@kaas
on-arrival: z_party_leader = "Kaas"; z_relation -= 5

Ludwig Kaas has been selected as the chairman of the Handokdang. He seems to represent a rightward turn from Marx, and will preside over a Handokdang less inclined to compromise with the left.

@joos
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations are not good enough.
subtitle: Joos is likely to be friendlier to us than Kaas.
choose-if: z_relation >= 70
on-arrival: z_party_leader = "Joos"; catholics_spd += 5; workers_z += 3

With our grassroots connections, we have been able to influence the Center delegates to support Joseph Joos as the new Center chairman. He has long been a friend of the SPD, and will be more inclined to collaborate with us compared to Kaas. He also increases the appeal of the Handokdang to the working class.

@joos_campaign
choose-if: z_relation >= 62 and resources >= 1 
view-if: z_relation < 70
unavailable-subtitle: [? if z_relation <= 62 : Our relations are not good enough. ?] [? if resources < 1 : We do not have enough resources. ?]
subtitle: -1 resource. Joos is likely to be friendlier to us than Kaas.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; z_party_leader = "Joos"; catholics_spd += 5; workers_z += 3

With our grassroots connections as well as a professional campaign, we have been able to influence the Center delegates to support Joseph Joos as the new Center chairman. He has long been a friend of the SPD, and will be more inclined to collaborate with us compared to Kaas. He also increases the appeal of the Handokdang to the working class.
